 "remarks": "Discover sophisticated townhouse living at Meadgate, a 14-unit architectural gem in downtown Greenwich. Enjoy the feeling of a single-family home with condo conveniences in this serene community with gardens over an acre. This elegant three-level residence includes two en-suite bedrooms upstairs with walk-in closets. The main level features a formal dining room, an airy living room with a cozy fireplace, and a patio accessed from the kitchen and dining room. A powder room completes this floor. The lower level includes a spacious room, ideal for a media room, office, gym, private garage, and laundry. Just two blocks from Greenwich Ave's dining and shopping and close to the train, Meadgate is the perfect blend of classic design and urban ease.",
